# Build context for deploy/nginx/Dockerfile, which is built from the repo root.
#
# Each frontend stage installs its packages from the lockfile, then copies its folder over the top.
# Without this, a checkout that has its own node_modules (the VPS, a laptop) overwrites the clean
# install with whatever happens to be there: a stray Tailwind 4 in frontend-admin/node_modules broke
# the admin build ("trying to use `tailwindcss` directly as a PostCSS plugin") while the lockfile
# still pins Tailwind 3. CI never saw it because its fresh checkout has no node_modules.
**/node_modules
**/dist
.git
